$DATUM Synthesis of
5,10-Bis(5-octylthiophen-2-yl)-2,7-bis(triisopropylsilyl)naphtho[1,2-b:5,6-b']dithiophene
(10) To a degassed solution of
5,10-Bis(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-2,7-bis(triisopropylsilyl)naphtho-
[1,2-b:5,6-b']dithiophene (2.15g, 2.5 mmol), 2-bromo-5-octhylthiophene
(2.75g, 10 mmol), K3PO4•nH2O (2.12 g, 10 mmol), and H2O (10 mL) in THF
(50 mL) was added Pd(PPh3)4 (231 mg, 0.25 mmol). The solution was
refluxed for 20 h and cooled to rt. The mixture was diluted with CHCl3,
washed with water, and dried (MgSO4). The residue was purified by column
chromatography on silica-gel eluted with hexane to give
5,10-Bis(5-octylthiophen-2-yl)-2,7-bis(triisopropylsilyl)naphtho[1,2-b:5,6-b']dithiophene.
white solid, yield (2.11 g, 89%). Mp 179-180 °C; 1HNMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
0.88 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 6H), 1.19 (d, J = 7.4 Hz, 32H), 1.25-1.40 (m, 20H),
3.33-3.47 (m, 2H), 1.46 (sept, J = 7.4 Hz, 6H), 1.78 (quin, J = 7.5 Hz,
4H), 2.92 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 4H), 6.90 (d, J = 3.5 Hz, 2H), 7.30 (d, J = 3.5
Hz, 2H), 8.05 (s, 2H), 8.10 (s, 2H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 11.9,
14.1, 18.7, 22.7, 29.3, 29.3, 29.4, 30.3, 31.8, 31.9, 120.9, 124.8,
124.9, 126.0, 129.3, 133.3, 135.1, 136.9, 140.2, 143.5, 146.6; MALDI-TOF
MS (matrix: 1,8,9-trihydroxyanthracene) found 940.40 (calcd for
C56H84S4Si2 exact mass: 940.50); HRMS (APCI): calcd for C56H84S4Si2 [M]+:
940.49889, found: 940.49750.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
