$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound S2. A solution of S1 (61.1 mg, 0.11 mmol, 1 equiv) in DMF (3.0
mL) was treated with potassium acetate (106 mg, 1.1 mmol, 10 equiv) and
bis(pinacolato)diborane (138 mg, 0.55 mmol, 5 equiv) at 25 °C. Ar was
bubbled through the mixture for 10 min. The reaction mixture was treated
with Pd(dppf)Cl2 (17.8 mg, 0.0218 mmol, 20 mol%) at room temperature.
After stirring the reaction mixture at 80 °C for 16 h, the resulting
mixture was quenched with the addition of water at 0 °C. The organic
materials were extracted with EtOAc and dried over anhydrous Na2SO4, then
concentrated under reduced pressure. PTLC (SiO2, 50% EtOAc-hexane).
Compound S2 (54.5 mg, 0.097 mmol, 89%). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.97
(s, 1H), 7.88 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 7.70 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 1H), 5.95 (d, J =
6.5 Hz, 1H), 4.16 (s, 1H), 3.62 (ddd, J = 11.5, 4.5, 3.0 Hz, 1H), 3.51
(s, 3H), 3.21 (ddd, J = 16.0, 13.5, 5.0 Hz, 1H), 3.09 (dt, J = 19.2, 3.5
Hz, 1H), 3.01 (dt, J = 8.5, 3.0 Hz, 1H), 2.85 (dt, J = 4.0, 12.5 Hz, 1H),
2.76 (dt, J = 13.5, 3.0 Hz, 1H), 2.64-2.58 (m, 1H), 2.45 (d, J = 8.0 Hz,
1H), 2.28-2.18 (m, 1H), 1.94-1.85 (m, 1H), 1.69 (dd, J = 13.0, 3.0 Hz,
1H), 1.60 (s, 9H), 1.35 (s, 12H), 1.06 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (125
MHz, CDCl3) δ 172.7, 150.2, 147.3, 139.4, 137.2, 130.3, 129.0, 125.3,
123.1, 118.7, 114.6, 83.9, 83.5, 58.6, 55.8, 52.8, 51.8, 38.4, 31.5,
28.0, 26.6, 24.8, 22.5, 21.7, 10.2; IR (film) νmax 2976, 1735, 1322,
1137, 730 cm-1 ; HRESI-TOFMS m/z 563.3288 (C32H43N2O6+H+ , required
563.3288); [α]D 23 +22 (c 0.5, CHCl3).
