$DATUM flow system, packed-bed reactor used, Suzuki-Miyaura cross-coupling
reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Suzuki-Miyaura Cross-Coupling of Heteroaryl Halides and Arylboronic Acids
