$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-(3,4-dimethylphenyl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine(1t).
An argon-purged mixture of
4-amino-5-iodo-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (2, 392
mg, 1 mmol), 3,4-dimethylphenylboronic acid (225 mg, 1.5 mmol), Na2CO3
(318 mg, 3 mmol), TPPTS (71 mg, 0.125 mmol), and Pd(OAc)2 (11 mg, 0.05
mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After
cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aqueous HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo. The residue was loaded on silica by
co-evaporation from chloroform/MeOH solution, and column chromatography
(SiO2, 0→2.5% MeOH in CHCl3).
4-Amino-5-(dibenzo[b,d]furan-4-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(1ad). Compound 1ad (381 mg, 88%) was prepared as described for 1t from 2
(392 mg, 1 mmol) and 4-dibenzofuranboronic acid. White foam. Mp 148-152
°C. [α]D -51.2 (c 0.240, DMSO). 1H NMR (600.1 MHz, DMSO-d 6): 3.56, 3.66
(2 × bddd, 2 × 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´,OH = 5.0, J 5´,4´ = 3.8, H-5´);
3.95 (td, 1H, J 4´,5´ = 3.8, J 4´,3´ = 3.1, H-4´); 4.14 (ddd, 1H, J 3´,2´
= 5.1, J 3´,OH = 4.8, J 3´,4´ = 3.1, H-3´); 4.55 (ddd, 1H, J 2´,OH = 6.5,
J 2´,1´ = 6.2, J 2´,3´ = 5.1, H-3´); 5.18 (d, 1H, J OH,3´ = 4.8, OH-3´);
5.26 (bt, 1H, J OH,5´ = 5.0, OH-5´); 5.41 (d, 1H, J OH,2´ = 6.5, OH-2´);
6.08 (bs, 2H, NH2); 6.18 (d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 6.2, H-1´); 7.43 (ddd, 1H, J
8,9 = 7.7, J 8,9 = 7.2, J 8,6 = 0.8, H-8-dibenzofuryl); 7.50-7.54 (m, 3H,
H-2,3,7-dibenzofuryl); 7.70 (dt, 1H, J 6,7 = 8.3, J 6,8 = J 6,9 = 0.8,
H-6-dibenzofuryl); 7.78 (s, 1H, H-6); 8.17 (m, 1H, H-1-dibenzofuryl);
8.19 (s, 1H, H-2); 8.21 (ddd, 1H, J 9,8 = 7.7, J 9,7 = 1.4, J 9,6 = 0.8,
H-9-dibenzofuryl). 13C NMR (150.9 MHz, DMSO-d 6): 61.93 (CH2-5´); 70.92
(CH-3´); 74.03 (CH-2´); 85.47 (CH-4´); 87.64 (CH-1´); 101.84 (C-4a);
109.82 (C-5); 112.09 (CH-6-dibenzofuryl); 119.07 (C-4-dibenzofuryl);
120.38 (CH-1-dibenzofuryl); 121.55 (CH-9-dibenzofuryl); 122.94 (CH-6);
123.43 (CH-8-dibenzofuryl); 123.80 (CH-2-dibenzofuryl); 124.04
(C-9a-dibenzofuryl); 124.38 (C-9b-dibenzofuryl); 127.89
(CH-7-dibenzofuryl); 128.68 (CH-3-dibenzofuryl); 150.87 (C-7a); 151.95
(CH-2); 153.45 (C-4a-dibenzofuryl); 155.72 (C-5a-dibenzofuryl); 157.67
(C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1623, 1587, 1574, 1542, 1454, 1189, 1121, 1080,1043,
862, 844, 795, 753 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 433 (M+H), 455 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI)
for C23H21N4O5 [M+H] calcd: 433.1506; found: 433.1506. Anal.
(C23H20N4O5•1.35H2O): C, H, N. Calcd for C23H20N4O5•1.35H2O: C, 60.48; H,
5.01; N, 12.27. Found: C, 60.72; H, 4.71; N, 11.91.
